;;   "nupkg"  NuGet.org Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntime 1.22.0 (published 2025-05-09, owner Microsoft, repository commit f217402897f40ebba457e2421bc0a4702771968e = rel-1.22.0).
;;            DESKTOP: runtimes/<rid>/native/ of the osx-arm64, osx-x64, linux-x64, linux-arm64 and win-x64 builds, and the C API headers (build/native/include).
;;            Checked when pinned: `dotnet nuget verify --all` = Microsoft Corporation AUTHOR signature plus the NuGet.org REPOSITORY countersignature, exit 0; the
