;;            ANDROID: the embedded AAR is byte-identical to the previously pinned Maven Central AAR (D906).
;;            IOS: the embedded XCFramework ZIP provides the static device and simulator archives linked into the adapter (D908).
;;
;; `bb tools/ppocr/ort.clj --fetch` downloads the package once. The extractor verifies SHA-256 and size for the package, nested mobile archives and installed files.
;; The layout under .cache/ppocr/<:directory>/ preserves the existing paths (lib/, include/, LICENSE, ThirdPartyNotices.txt and the desktop library symlinks).
;;
;; To move a pin: change the package or entry, its :bytes and :sha256 together (shasum -a 256 of the DOWNLOAD), re-run `bb ppocr-fetch`, `bb ppocr-hosts`, and fix
;; release/third-party.edn and release/packs/packs.edn.
